WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:10.370
Kim Il-Sung's grandson, Jong-Nam, was sacked
as heir to North Korea after being arrested

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:16.049
trying to enter Japan on a false passport
to visit Disneyland

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:28.400
When 
customers visited the UK's first supermarkets

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.829
they were afraid to pick up goods in case
they were told off.

00:00:33.829 --> 00:00:41.149
Since smoking was banned in 2004, the main
currency in US prisons is mackerel.

00:00:41.149 --> 00:00:49.180
It was 33 years after loo paper was invented
in Green Bay, Wisconsin, that it could finally

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:52.700
be advertised as 'splinter free'.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:01:01.500
The shortest war ever fought was between Britain
and Zanzibar on August 27, 1896.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:06.020
Zanzibar surrendered after 38 minutes.

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:13.890
Kestrels can locate voles from the sky because
of ultra-violet light reflected by their urine.

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:19.220
Bubblewrap was first produced in a New Jersey
garage in 1957.

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:24.400
Its inventors were trying to make easy-wipe
textured wallpaper.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:32.520
Between 1917 and 1940, the cure for patients
with syphilis was to give them malaria.

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:40.790
Since its discovery in 1930, Pluto has travelled
only a third of its way round the Sun.

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:48.079
The proud owner of the first silicone breast
implant was a dog called Esmeralda.

00:01:48.079 --> 00:01:56.189
Nelson Mandela was not removed from the US
terror watch list until 2008.

00:01:56.189 --> 00:02:06.149
Almost half of all Americans today are classified
as 'living in poverty'. 46% pay no income

00:02:06.149 --> 00:02:07.520
tax.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:15.620
The word hundred is derived from the word
"hundrath", which actually means 120 and not

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:17.120
100.

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:24.069
Sucking a king's nipples was a gesture of
submission in ancient Ireland.

00:02:24.069 --> 00:02:32.319
In Japan, Tintin is called Tantan because
Tintin is pronounced 'Chin-Chin' and means

00:02:32.319 --> 00:02:36.819
'penis'.

